  "findings": [
    "The 4194304-byte first I/F plane is byte-identical to the calibrated _02_iof.fits payload, SHA256 1569962a56c80b1c126d419ee0c5da15d4afe2259a55650f4678421d002326f1. This verifies these archived stored samples, not a NASA publisher crop or independent calibration.",
    "All sixteen labelled arrays occupy contiguous 4194304-byte regions with IEEE754 big-endian float32 samples. File is FITS-block aligned with 896 trailing zero bytes.",
    "Each of the fifteen geometry planes contains 786432 exact float32 -1E10 values and no exact -999 or float32-rounded -1E32 values. Every stored sample is finite. Counts do not independently establish a validity mask or terrain coverage.",
    "The XML labels and FITS PXOUTWIN card specify -1E10. The collection overview explicitly says pixels outside original window 2 retain PXOUTWIN/not_applicable values. SIS page78 prose instead lists -1E32 for backplane outside-window values. Preserve this documentary difference without modifying any raster or automatically adopting a mask.",
    "Label references Dimorphos v004 DSK, PCK12 and FK005. The separately audited later PCK15/FK007/008 are not substitutions for these processing dependencies.",
    "SIS pages29\u201331 describe body-specific geometry and potential-derived elevation. Historical assumed density/spin and shape-model conventions do not establish present physical measurements or geological elevation."
  ],
  "validationMethod": [
    "Original TLS-verified archive downloads retained unchanged; all listed SHA256 and sizes checked.",
    "XML array offsets compared to actual FITS byte bounds; all sixteen payloads hashed; first plane compared byte-for-byte with original calibrated product.",
    "All stored float32 values scanned for finiteness and explicit sentinel diagnostics; comparison constants rounded to float32 without changing input samples.",
    "Original FITS header cards retained in ignored research preparation; source SIS relevant pages visually inspected in earlier preparation. No SPICE evaluation or calibration pipeline executed.",
    "SIS PDF page78 newly rendered and visually inspected: printed PXOUTWIN=-1E32, visible editing markup and Version2.0 footer in v3-named PDF retained."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Exact first-plane payload equality establishes stored I/F sample correspondence between these two archived products only, not independently reproduced geometry or calibration.",
    "Label not_applicable_constant -1E10 differs from SIS backplane prose -1E32; retained without repair or blanket masking.",
    "Label DSK v004 and PCK12/FK005 references are processing provenance, not independently validated frame registration or permission to substitute later kernels.",
